# The SECOND untrusted path an .obj carries: the material library itself.
#
# ModelImporter::convert reads the `mtllib` lines to stage the .mtl sidecars
# precisely (no directory sweeps) — and used to resolve whatever the file said
# against the model's directory and stage it if it existed. `mtllib
# ../../outside_secret.mtl` therefore copied a file from outside the model's
# folder into the store as this asset's sidecar.
#
# The suite plants <tmp>/outer/outside_secret.mtl beside the .png and asserts
# no staged file of this import lives outside <tmp>/outer/inner/model/.
mtllib ../../outside_secret.mtl

v 0.0 0.0 0.0
v 1.0 0.0 0.0
v 0.0 1.0 0.0

vn 0.0 0.0 1.0

f 1//1 2//1 3//1
